# Layer A density v4 fixture: 41-toggle-machine combining BOTH
# nested expressions AND compact-LAM-param inference.
#
# Two intermediate declarations (negatedState, emptyOutputsV) collapse
# into nested FIELD_LIST values (Agent A's Slice 10). LAM param
# annotations `s:boolT e:unitT` elided — `s` is inferred from its use
# inside the nested `(APP not [s])` (the not builtin's signature is
# boolT → boolT); `e` is inferred from the StateMachine's transitionFn
# (state, event) signature with the inputStream's eventType being unitT.
#
# Round-trip: canonical hash equals 41-toggle-machine.json's.
@v=1 root=toggleMachine
emptyOutputsT PRD []
stateFieldT PRF "state" boolT
outputsFieldT PRF "outputs" emptyOutputsT
resultT PRD [stateFieldT outputsFieldT]
transitionResult PV resultT [state=(APP not [s]) outputs=(PV emptyOutputsT [])]
transitionLambda LAM [s e] transitionResult
inputStream ESE unitT
toggleMachine SM transitionLambda false [inputStream] [] [receiveFx]
